# Decompose a reducible representation into irreducible representations for point group 3m

crystod-group --decompose --point-group 3m  

* Point group *
3m

* Reducible representation *

1E: 4
2C3: 1
3sgv: 2

* Result *
2(A1) + 1(E)




* Point group *
3m

* Reducible representation *

1E: 5
2C3: 2
3sgv: 1

* Result *
2(A1) + 1(A2) + 1(E)




* Point group *
3m

* Reducible representation *

1E: 7
2C3: 1
3sgv: -1

* Result *
1(A1) + 2(A2) + 2(E)




crystod-group --decompose --point-group 432     

* Point group *
432

* Reducible representation *

1E: 5
6C4: -1
3C2: 1
8C3: -1
6C2': 1

* Result *
1(E) + 1(T2)






crystod-group --decompose --point-group m-3m     

* Point group *
m-3m

* Reducible representation *

1E: 5
8C3: -1
6C2: 1
6C4: -1
3C4^2: 1
1i: 5
6S4: -1
8S6: -1
3sgh: 1
6sgd: 1

* Result *
1(Eg) + 1(T2g)
